{"product_id":"the-royal-game","title":"The Royal Game","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe inspirational story of the Pastons, a family who rose from obscurity to the very heart of Court politics and intrigue during the Wars of the Roses.England, 1444. Three women who came from nowhere to challenge the course of history…King Henry VI’s grip on the crown hangs by a thread as the Wars of the Roses begin to tear England apart. Everyone must choose between York or Lancaster. And from the ashes of war, the House of Paston begins its rise to power.Led by three visionary women, the Pastons are a family from humble peasant beginnings who rely upon cunning, raw ambition, and good fortune in order to survive.Their ability to plot and scheme sees them overcome imprisonment, violence and betrayal, to eventually secure for their family a castle and a place at the heart of the Yorkist Court. But success breeds jealousy and brings them dangerous enemies…An inspirational story of courage and resilience, The Royal Game charts the rise of three remarkable women from obscurity to the very heart of Court politics and intrigue.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 153 x 234\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Anne O'Brien\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780008422851\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 496\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803738988697,"sku":"17RA-69780008422851","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f3bec31b6ca_The_Royal_Game_Anne_O_Brien.jpg?v=1760808976","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-royal-game","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}